gtcrn-go
========

A pure-Go port of GTCRN (https://github.com/Xiaobin-Rong/gtcrn), ported from
upstream commit 502ebfab64da7c4a9af78dcb9c6ceef1ebb01c73.

The network, its streaming form and the trained weights are the work of
Xiaobin Rong and contributors. This port is distributed under the same terms
as upstream, MIT; LICENSE is upstream's, verbatim.

weights.bin is upstream's checkpoints/model_trained_on_dns3.tar converted by
tools/export/export.py. sha256:
716a4c29d74bb81d3d4e32e41d7ac1787499e8c0da2406d9d544336efb51d61e
